cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  For citation of the underlying MP-PCA denoising method and its
  various technical enhancements, see the "Citation" and "References"
  sections of the README.
title: dwidenoise2
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Smith
    given-names: "Robert E."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3636-4642"
    affiliation: The Florey Institute of Neuroscience and Mental Health
version: 1.0.0
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lestropie/dwidenoise2"
url: "https://github.com/Lestropie/dwidenoise2"
abstract: >-
  A reworked implementation of Marchenko-Pastur (MP) Principal
  Components Analysis (PCA) based denoising of >3D MRI data, building
  upon the "dwidenoise" command in MRtrix3.
